       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SRELEASE.
       AUTHOR.        KURT MOVSESIAN/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *   S R E L E A S E                                          *
      *                                                            *
      *   THIS SUB PROGRAM CREATES SHIPPING RELEASES               *
      *   EITHER INSTANTLY (TO PRINT) OR ENTERED IN A              *
      *   BATCH FILE FOR PROCESSING LATER.                         *
      *   NOTE THE REQUISITION IF ANY IS CLOSED OUT AT             *
      *   THE TIME THE RELEASE IS CREATED                          *
      *                                                            *
      **************************************************************
      * N O T E    T H I S   S U B R O U T I N E   I S             *
      *         C A L L E D    B Y :                               *
      *      1. TREQUPDT                                           *
      *      2. TRELMAN                                            *
      **************************************************************


      *****************************************************************
      **            M O D I F I C A T I O N    H I S T O R Y
      *****************************************************************
      *    AUG. 94   JE COFFMAN  REQ #6527
      *    ADDED CALL TO SCHATREF IF THE USER OPTION SWITCH IS
      *    SET REQUIRING THAT CHAT NUMBERS BE INCLUDED ON CSIS
      *    DOCUMENTS CONTAINING CORPORATE CODED ITEMS.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *    02/22/1995   CA ZUBEK   REQ #94-049
      *    ADDED LOGIC TO INCLUDE TAXES IN THE PO BUDGETED
      *    AMOUNT FIELD.  THE LOGIC WAS COPIED FROM "SADDPITM."
      *    ** NOTE:  IF THE TAX CALCULATION LOGIC IS CHANGED
      *    IN THIS PROGRAM, YOU MAY HAVE TO MAKE THE SAME CHANGE
      *    IN THE PROGRAM "SADDPITM," SINCE IT CONTAINS THE SAME
      *    LOGIC.
      *    ** NOTE:  ADDED CALL TO "SCALCBGT" SO THIS LOGIC NO
      *    LONGER EXISTS IN THIS PROGRAM.   5/22/98
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *    08/09/1995   CA YODER   REQ #94-022
      *    ADDED LOGIC TO CALCULATE THE SHIP DATE USING SHIP TIME
      *    FIELD.  BEFORE THIS CHANGE, EXPECT DATE AND SHIP DATE
      *    WERE EITHER THE SAME OR BLANK.  CALCULATIONS WERE
      *    ADDED TO USE THE ESTIMATED LEAD TIME (SHIP TIME) TO
      *    MAKE THE TWO DATES DIFFERENT.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *    01/23/1996   CA YODER   REQ #95-039
      *    ADDED CALL TO PROGRAM "SRELVEND" TO FIND OUT IF THE USER
      *    CHOSE THE LOWEST COST VENDOR (FOR INSTANT SHIPPING RELEASE
      *    ONLY).
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *    06/17/1996   CA YODER
      *    MODIFIED FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.  ALSO CHANGED ALL
      *    REFERENCES FOR DATE CONVERSIONS TO "JULGREG".
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *    08/27/1997   CA YODER   REQ #97-008
      *    CHANGED PRINTING OF THE SHIPPING RELEASE TO USE "TSTRMJOB"
      *    TO SUBMIT THE PO PRINT INSTEAD OF PRINTING ONLINE.  NAPANEE
      *    WANTED TO TRY AND ELIMINATE SOME OF THE WAIT TIME DUE TO
      *    PRINTING.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *    10/27/1997  CA YODER
      *     ADDED LOGIC TO MOVE NOTIFY USERID TO DPOITEM AND DSHIPREL
      *     IF ONE IS FOUND IN THE PARAMETERS PASSED TO THIS PROGRAM.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *    05/22/98  CA YODER
      *    ADDED CALL TO "SCALCBGT" TO CALCULATE THE CORRECT
      *    BUDGET AMOUNT FOR THE PO.  REMOVED TAX LOGIC THAT
      *    EXISTED IN THIS PROGRAM.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *    09/14/98  CA YODER
      *    CHANGED STANDARD INSTRUCTION AREA TO CONTAIN ALL STANDARD
      *    INSTRUCTIONS BEFORE AND AFTER, NOT JUST THE FIRST 3 AFTER;
      *    THE REST WERE NOT CARRIED OVER.  VALLEYFIELD WAS HAVING
      *    A PROBLEM WITH THE STANDARD INSTRUCTIONS "DISAPPEARING."
      *    FOR BATCH PROCESSING, A NEW DESCRIPTION LINE "99" WAS
      *    ADDED TO HOLD ALL 12 STANDARD INSTRUCTIONS.  THIS WAS DONE
      *    INSTEAD OF EXPANDING CS2900 IN THE MIDDLE OF A RELEASE.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *    06/07/99   CA YODER   (DECATUR REQUEST)
      *    RE-COMPILED TO PICK UP MTAX DATABASE CHANGE TO
      *    EXPAND TAX RATE PERCENTAGE FROM 2 DECIMAL PLACES TO 4.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *    09/09/99  CA YODER    NAPANEE REQUEST
      *    MOVE MSTORERM MARKET COST TO UNIT VALUE FIELD FOR
      *    REPAIR PURCHASE ORDER ITEMS.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *    NOV 1999  JE COFFMAN  NAPANEE REQUEST
      *    ADD KEYWORD/MODIFIER AND MANUFACTURER AND MANUFACTURER
      *    PART NUMBER TO SCREEN SO PERSON DOING THE RELEASE HAS
      *    A BETTER IDEA OF WHAT THE PART IS THAT THEY ARE
      *    RELEASING.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *    03/01/00  CA YODER    NAPANEE REQUEST    (D. STUBBS)
      *    REMOVED LOGIC TO UPDATE MARKET COST FOR REPAIR ORDERS.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *    05/04/01  JE COFFMAN  LAWTON REQUEST
      *    AT JIM JEFFER'S REQUEST - ADDED THE ABILITY TO 'H' (HOLD)
      *    ENTRIES IN THE SHIPPING RELEASE FILE UNTIL RELEASED
      *    VIA MENU OPTION PS2X.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *    02/26/02  BE GEISER
      *    ADDL DESC LINES WERE NOT BEING SET TO 'H' (HOLD) IN THE
      *    SHIPPING RELEASE FILE. ADDED LOGIC TO SET TO 'H' AS NEEDED.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
DCR01 *  04/02/2003   DCR01   D. RAUCH
DCR01 *    ADDED LOGIC FOR PO LOGGING
      *****************************************************************

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.

       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.

       SPECIAL-NAMES.  I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZRELMAN-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

           SELECT MCLASS-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS4901
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-PK-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
