      **************************************************

       COPY TDATECHK IN COPYLIB.

       01  CURRENT-DATE.
           05  CUR-CC                    PIC X(2).
           05  CUR-DATE-YMD.
               10  CUR-YY                PIC X(2).
               10  CUR-MM                PIC X(2).
               10  CUR-DD                PIC X(2).

