      **   FIELDS FOR CALCULATING THE SHIP DATE   **
      **********************************************

       01  JULIAN-DATE.
           05  JUL-CC                    PIC XX.
           05  JUL-YY                    PIC XX.
           05  JUL-DDD                   PIC X(3).
       01  JULIAN-DATE-9  REDEFINES JULIAN-DATE.
           05  JUL-CCYY                  PIC 9(4).
           05  JUL-DDD-9                 PIC 9(3).

       01  GREG-DATE.
           05  GREG-CC                   PIC XX.
           05  GREG-DATE-YMD.
               10  GREG-YY               PIC XX.
               10  GREG-MM               PIC XX.
               10  GREG-DD               PIC XX.

       01  DAY-DIGIT                     PIC X.
