               10  STRM-PRE-RUN-CARD2   PIC X(80) VALUE SPACES.
               10  STRM-PRE-RUN-CARD3   PIC X(80) VALUE SPACES.
               10  STRM-PRE-RUN-CARD4   PIC X(80) VALUE SPACES.
           05  STRM-RUN-CARD            PIC X(80) VALUE SPACES.
