               10  STRM-MOD-ORDER       PIC X     VALUE SPACES.
               10  STRM-CANC-ORDER      PIC X     VALUE SPACES.
               10  STRM-PO-PRINT-NUM    PIC 9(2) COMP-4 VALUE ZEROS.
               10  STRM-PO-ITEMS        PIC X(60) VALUE SPACES.
               10  STRM-NO-ESCAPE-PRINT PIC X     VALUE SPACES.
           05  STRM-OPTION-CARD2        PIC X(640) VALUE SPACES.
           05  STRM-OPTION-CARD2-CTR    PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
